# Barbarian

A fierce warrior of primitive background who can enter a battle rage.

## Core Traits

| Property            | Value                          |
| ------------------- | ------------------------------ |
| **Hit Die**         | d12                            |
| **Primary Ability** | Strength                       |
| **Armor**           | Light, Medium, Shields         |
| **Weapons**         | Simple, Martial                |

## Becoming a Barbarian

| Level | Tier Bonus | Features                              | Rages | Rage Damage |
| ----- | ----------------- | ------------------------------------- | ----- | ----------- |
| 1     | +2                | Rage, Unarmored Defense               | 2     | +2          |
| 2     | +2                | Reckless Attack, Danger Sense         | 2     | +2          |
| 3     | +2                | Primal Path, Optional Class Feature   | 3     | +2          |
| 4     | +2                | Ability Score Improvement             | 3     | +2          |
| 5     | +3                | Extra Attack, Fast Movement           | 3     | +2          |
| 6     | +3                | Path Feature                          | 4     | +3          |
| 7     | +3                | Feral Instinct                        | 4     | +3          |
| 8     | +3                | Ability Score Improvement             | 4     | +3          |
| 9     | +4                | Brutal Critical (1 die)               | 4     | +3          |
| 10    | +4                | Path Feature                          | 4     | +3          |

## Features

### Rage (Level 1)

While raging, you add your tier bonus to Strength checks and Strength saving throws.
